{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setUser:emails:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUser:emails:"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setUser:emails:","title":"setUser:emails:"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setuser:emails:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"setUser:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"userId"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"emails:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSArray"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"emails","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"userId","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The custom user identifier."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Array of email address strings to associate with the user."}]}],"name":"emails"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Convenience method that combines ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setUserId:"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"setEmails:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" into a single","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"server request. This is more efficient than calling both methods separately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ensures atomic association of user ID with emails.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this during login or registration flows when you have both user ID"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and email available simultaneously."}]},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","text":"Example","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Complete registration with user ID and emails:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class RegistrationManager {","","    func completeRegistration(_ registration: RegistrationData) {","        \/\/ Create user on backend","        APIClient.shared.createUser(registration) { result in","            guard case .success(let user) = result else { return }","","            \/\/ Set both user ID and emails in single operation","            var emails = [user.email]","            if let secondaryEmail = registration.secondaryEmail {","                emails.append(secondaryEmail)","            }","","            Pushwoosh.configure.setUser(user.id, emails: emails)","","            \/\/ Set initial user tags","            Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","                \"registration_date\": ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: Date()),","                \"registration_source\": registration.source.rawValue,","                \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","                \"has_completed_onboarding\": false","            ])","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["   when you need confirmation."]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets user identifier and emails together in a single operation."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setUser:emails:"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setUser:emails:":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setuser:emails:","abstract":[{"text":"Sets user identifier and emails together in a single operation.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setUser:emails:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"setUser:emails:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUser:emails:"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"setUser:emails:"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"abstract":[],"title":"PWConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","role":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}